<title>POLAND: POLIFARB-C Q1 NET RISES TO PLN 5.6 MLN.</title>
<headline>POLIFARB-C Q1 NET RISES TO PLN 5.6 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-04-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polifarb Cieszyn preliminary</p>
<p>results for Q1 ending March 31, 1997.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>					     Q1 1997     Q1 1996</p>
<p>    operating profit			8.83  vs    3.83</p>
<p>    pre-tax profit			  9.22  vs    2.74</p>
<p>    net profit				5.60  vs    1.52</p>
<p>NOTE - Full company name is: Polifarb Cieszyn SA.</p>
<p>    net sales				73.54  vs   59.13</p>
<p>    costs of sales			 52.47  vs   45.53</p>
<p>    extraordinary profit		  0.00  vs    0.00</p>
<p>    income tax				3.62  vs    1.22</p>
<p>    other taxes			     0.00  vs    0.00</p>
<p>    financial revenues		   16.58  vs    2.07</p>
<p>    financial costs			16.19  vs    3.16</p>
<p>    investment				2.73   vs   2.93</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
